#. Plugin Name of the plugin
msgid "WCPOS Pro – Point of Sale for WooCommerce"
msgstr "WCPOS Pro – Point de Vente pour WooCommerce"

#. Plugin URI of the plugin
msgid "https://wcpos.com/pro"
msgstr "https://wcpos.com/pro"

#. Description of the plugin
msgid ""
"A complete Point of Sale solution for WooCommerce. Pro includes all "
"features from the free plugin plus multi-store support, custom receipts, "
"and more."
msgstr ""
"Une solution complète de point de vente pour WooCommerce. La version Pro "
"inclut toutes les fonctionnalités du plugin gratuit plus la gestion "
"multi-boutiques, des reçus personnalisés, et plus encore."

#. Author of the plugin
msgid "kilbot"
msgstr "kilbot"

#. Author URI of the plugin
msgid "http://www.kilbot.com"
msgstr "http://www.kilbot.com"

msgid "Stores"
msgstr "Boutiques"

msgid "Cashiers"
msgstr "Caissiers"

msgid "Gateways"
msgstr "Gateways"

msgid "WooCommerce POS Pro is now standalone."
msgstr "WooCommerce POS Pro est maintenant autonome."

msgid ""
"The Pro plugin includes all features from the free version. You can safely "
"deactivate and delete this plugin."
msgstr ""
"Le plugin Pro inclut toutes les fonctionnalités de la version gratuite. "
"Vous pouvez désactiver et supprimer ce plugin en toute sécurité."

